hovers:
  3 "The last 600 ticks since the box opened: a median of 60 ms. 0 dropped since the run began, 0 a second on the worst Output in the last second."
  4 "Ticks in the last second whose draw found the tick two before it still on the GPU and waited for it: the two-tick bound on the GPU's queue. The renderer's throttle, which submits only once at most one earlier submission is still running, usually holds a tick back before it gets there, so this can read 0% while the tick waits; waiting on GPU, under CPU per tick, is the whole of the wait. 12 since the run began. A frame drops only where a viewer holds every target of an Output's ring (held) or a render's wait for a frame ran out (capture)."
  5 "The synth's draw on the GPU, first command to last, by part: a mean over the last second. The whole process is the render engine this process used over the last second, from the kernel's own counters: the editor's painting and every picture window with it."
 14 "The synth's tick from the top of one to the top of the next, split by the thread's own CPU clock: time off the CPU inside a phase is waiting on the GPU, the rest is work, and the sleep to the deadline is idle. The rows add up to the tick."
 31 "The editor's own redraw, off egui's clock: only how often the canvas is painted. A minimized or covered window moves these and nothing else. GPU per frame is the editor's painting on the GPU, every panel, window and picture blit, from two timestamps on its own context read a few frames later."
 32 "Every Output by the GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: the drawing ones costliest first, then the idle ones, which are not drawn and keep a muted figure. A name goes to its node."
 33 "output100 on Effect kernels, 1280×720, showing Kuwahara. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 12.8 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 34 "output101 on Effect manglers, 1280×720, showing Wavefold. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 6.4 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 35 "output102 on Sources, 1280×720, showing Mandelbrot. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 4.3 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 36 "output103 on Effect kernels, 1280×720, showing Slime Mold. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 3.2 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 37 "output104 on Effect manglers, 1280×720, showing Kuwahara. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 2.6 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 38 "output105 on Sources, 1280×720, showing Wavefold. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 2.1 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 39 "output106 on Effect kernels, 1280×720, showing Mandelbrot. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 1.8 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 40 "output107 on Effect manglers, 1280×720, showing Slime Mold. The GPU's own time for the last frame it drew: 1.6 ms, and 14.0 the worst of two seconds. Drawn every tick: on the workspace being looked at."
 42 "The graph, the undo history, the run and the last file action."
 43 "Each CPU node's own line, grouped by kind. A name goes to its node."
